<section class="v27-adam wrap" id="meet-adam"><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam-studio-hero.webp" alt="Adam Kasick at RIPL Wealth" loading="lazy"/><div><p class="eyebrow">A PERSONAL INTRODUCTION</p><h2>I've been on your <em>side of the table.</em></h2><p>I've built and operated businesses myself. I understand the decisions, responsibilities, and tradeoffs that come with owning one.</p><a href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="adam">Let's talk →</a></div></section>
<div class="section-band section-band--white"><section class="section wrap story-section" id="recognition"><figure class="recognition-team-photo"><img src="/images/ripl-home-team.jpg" width="1536" height="1024" alt="The RIPL Wealth team together at their office" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></figure><p class="eyebrow">THE BIGGER PICTURE</p><h2>THE BUSINESS IS BUILT. <em>NOW LET'S BUILD YOUR FINANCIAL FREEDOM.</em></h2><div class="story-copy"><p>You've probably spent years making decisions that move your business forward.</p><p>Hiring the right people. Finding opportunities. Solving problems. Making sure things get done.</p><p>But here's something worth thinking about:</p><p><strong>Who's giving that same attention to the life you're building outside your business?</strong></p><p>Maybe you already have a CPA, an investment advisor, and other professionals you trust. That's great.</p><p>But who's connecting all those moving parts to what you actually want your life to look like?</p><p><strong>Because having good people working on individual pieces isn't always the same as having someone focused on the whole picture.</strong></p></div></section></div>
<div class="section-band section-band--warm"><section class="section wrap story-section clarity" id="clarity"><p class="eyebrow">CLARITY BEFORE PRODUCTS</p><h2>YOU'RE <em>REALLY SMART.</em></h2><blockquote class="adam-quote">“Successful people make excellent decisions when they can see their options with clarity.”<cite>— Chase Bellefeuille, Managing Partner, RIPL Wealth</cite></blockquote><div class="story-copy"><p>You built a successful business by making good decisions. You don't need someone telling you what to do.</p><p>But what if there are financial strategies you haven't had the chance to explore?</p><p><strong>The right conversation can introduce new options, clarify the trade-offs, and help turn good ideas into action.</strong></p></div><a class="button quiz-entry-button section-cta" href="#quiz" data-quiz-link data-placement="clarity">Take the Free Quiz →</a></section></div>
<div class="section-band section-band--white"><section class="section wrap story-section how-help" id="how-help"><p class="eyebrow">HOW I HELP</p><h2>GOOD IDEAS AREN'T ENOUGH. <em>EXECUTION IS EVERYTHING.</em></h2><div class="story-copy"><p>You've probably got a list of financial things you've been meaning to get around to.</p><p>Ideas you've had. Conversations you need to have. Decisions you know deserve attention.</p><p>The problem usually isn't a shortage of good ideas.</p><p><strong>It's finding the time to turn them into action.</strong></p><p>And when you finally have some free time, shouldn't you get to enjoy it?</p><p>That's where I come in.</p><p>My role is to bring ideas worth considering, help organize conversations with your other financial professionals, and work with you on next steps—so important decisions get the attention they deserve.</p><h3>Think of me as a point of coordination for your financial decisions.</h3><p>Your CPA, attorney, insurance professional, and investment advisor each have important responsibilities. I help you see how their work fits together and who owns the next step. Each professional remains responsible for advice within their own specialty.</p></div><div class="section-cta"><p>Not ready for a meeting? That's okay. Tell me what's on your mind. I'll personally respond.</p><a class="button outline" href="#ask-question" data-placement="how-help-email">Have a question? Start with an email →</a></div></section></div>

<div class="section-band section-band--white"><section class="section wrap library" id="videos" data-ripl-video-library="podcast-highlights-2026-11-17"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">PODCAST HIGHLIGHTS</p><h2>YOU'VE WORKED HARD FOR YOUR MONEY. <em>NOW WHAT?</em></h2><p>Four podcast highlights on margin, purpose, giving every dollar a job, and simplifying financial decisions. If one resonates, bring it to our conversation.</p></div><div id="video-grid" class="video-grid">{featuredVideos.map(v=><article class="video-card" data-video-stage={v.stage}><div class="video-thumb" data-video-container>{v.youtubeId?<button class="video-play-button" type="button" data-video-id={v.youtubeId} aria-label={`Play ${v.title} on this page`}><img loading="lazy" src={v.thumbnail || `https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${v.youtubeId}/maxresdefault.jpg?v=20261117`} onerror={v.thumbnail ? undefined : `this.onerror=null;this.src='https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${v.youtubeId}/hqdefault.jpg?v=20261117';`} alt=""/><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span></button>:<><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam.webp" loading="lazy" alt=""/><span>Soon</span></>}</div><div><h3>{v.title}</h3><p>{v.summary}</p>{!v.youtubeId&&<span class="video-soon">Video coming soon</span>}</div></article>)}</div></section></div>

<div class="section-band section-band--white"><section class="section wrap question-section" id="ask-question"><p class="eyebrow">ANOTHER WAY TO START</p><h2>HAVE A QUESTION? <em>ASK US.</em></h2><p>You don't need to take a quiz or schedule a meeting to ask what's on your mind. Please don't include account numbers, tax returns, or other sensitive information.</p><form id="ask-question-form"><div class="question-form-fields"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required/></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required/></label></div><label>Your question<textarea name="question" rows="5" maxlength="2000" required></textarea></label><div class="lead-honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label></div><button class="button primary" type="submit">Send My Question</button><p id="ask-question-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="fine">We'll use your information to respond. Sending a question does not subscribe you to marketing emails. <a href="/money-at-work-privacy/">Privacy details</a>.</p></form><p>Prefer to talk? <a href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="question">Book a free 20-minute Zoom conversation</a>.</p></section></div>
</main><footer><div class="wrap footer-top"><a class="footer-brand" href="#main"><img src="/ripl-logo.png" width="100" alt="RIPL Wealth"/></a><div><strong>RIPL Wealth, LLC</strong><p>Fort Collins, Colorado</p><a href="/money-at-work-privacy/">Privacy</a> · <a href="/disclosures/">Disclosures</a></div></div><div class="wrap footer-disclosures"><p>RIPL Wealth is a registered investment adviser. Registration does not imply a certain level of skill or training. RIPL Wealth does not provide tax or legal advice; please consult your tax and legal professionals. Investing involves risk, including the possible loss of principal. No strategy can guarantee a profit, protect against loss, or ensure tax savings.</p><p>RIPL may coordinate with independent legal, tax, insurance, or other professionals. RIPL does not receive compensation for referrals to other professionals. RIPL is not affiliated with or endorsed by FINRA, the SEC, or other referenced organizations.</p><p>Opinions expressed by Chase Bellefeuille and Adam Kasick are their own and may not reflect the views of RIPL Wealth.</p><p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} RIPL Wealth · Give every dollar a job.</p></div></footer>
<dialog id="hero-video-dialog" class="hero-video-dialog" aria-label="Meet Adam introduction video"><div class="hero-dialog-shell"><button type="button" class="hero-dialog-close" aria-label="Close introduction video">✕</button><div class="hero-dialog-player" id="hero-dialog-player"></div></div></dialog><div id="calendly-modal" class="calendly-modal" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Book a free 20-minute Zoom conversation"><div class="calendly-dialog"><div class="calendly-dialog-top"><strong>Let's Talk · 20-minute Zoom</strong><button id="calendly-close" type="button" aria-label="Close booking window">✕</button></div><div id="calendly-frame-container" class="calendly-frame-container"></div><p class="calendly-fallback">Having trouble? <a id="calendly-external" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Calendly in a new tab ↗</a></p></div></div><script type="module" src="/money-at-work/campaign.js"></script><script is:inline>
(function(){const scenes=document.querySelectorAll('.v27-scene:not(.v27-guided-climb)');let busy=false;function update(){busy=false;for(const section of scenes){const frame=section.querySelector('iframe');if(!frame||!frame.contentWindow)continue;const r=section.getBoundingClientRect();const span=Math.max(1,r.height-innerHeight);const progress=Math.max(0,Math.min(1,-r.top/span));try{frame.contentWindow.postMessage({type:'riplSceneProgress',progress},'*')}catch(e){}}}function tick(){if(!busy){busy=true;requestAnimationFrame(update)}}addEventListener('scroll',tick,{passive:true});addEventListener('resize',tick);document.querySelectorAll('.v27-scene iframe').forEach(f=>f.addEventListener('load',tick));tick()})();
</script><script is:inline>
/* Guided mountain journey: button/tap input only; the page keeps native scrolling. */
(function(){
  const scene=document.querySelector('.v27-guided-climb');
  if(!scene)return;
  const frame=scene.querySelector('iframe');
  const stages=[
    {name:'Talent',kicker:'BASE CAMP · TALENT',title:'It starts with what you’re great at.',copy:'A gift, a drive, a craft. Something worth building a life around.'},
    {name:'Skills',kicker:'CAMP 1 · SKILLS',title:'Long days, hard lessons.',copy:'You sharpen that talent into skills the world will pay for.'},
    {name:'Margin',kicker:'CAMP 2 · MARGIN',title:'Room to breathe, for the first time.',copy:'Money above what you need to live on. Earn more, spend less, ideally both.'},
    {name:'Strategy',kicker:'CAMP 3 · STRATEGY',title:'A clear target, and a map.',copy:'Every dollar gets a job, and every job points the same direction.'},
    {name:'Growth',kicker:'CAMP 4 · GROWTH',title:'One step at a time.',copy:'Steady growth that carries you closer to your target, season after season.'},
    {name:'Freedom',kicker:'FREEDOM',title:'Work becomes a choice.',copy:'Financial freedom is in reach. You could stop here.'},
    {name:'Impact',kicker:'THE SUMMIT · IMPACT',title:'The ripple reaches everyone around you.',copy:'Freedom opens new doors: to make an impact through your work, your family and your community.'}
  ];
  const progress=[...scene.querySelectorAll('[data-climb-step]')];
  const back=scene.querySelector('[data-climb-back]');
  const next=scene.querySelector('[data-climb-next]');
  const count=scene.querySelector('[data-climb-count]');
  const name=scene.querySelector('[data-climb-name]');
  const kicker=scene.querySelector('[data-climb-story-kicker]');
  const title=scene.querySelector('[data-climb-story-title]');
  const copy=scene.querySelector('[data-climb-story-copy]');
  let step=0;
  function notifyFrame(){
    if(frame&&frame.contentWindow){
      frame.contentWindow.postMessage({type:'riplGuidedClimb',step},location.origin);
    }
  }
  function select(index){
    if(!Number.isInteger(index)||index<0||index>=stages.length)return;
    step=index;
    name.textContent=stages[step].name.toUpperCase();
    kicker.textContent=stages[step].kicker;
    title.textContent=stages[step].title;
    copy.textContent=stages[step].copy;
    count.textContent=String(step+1).padStart(2,'0')+' / 07';
    back.disabled=step===0;
    next.innerHTML=step===stages.length-1?'Continue <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>':'Next step <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>';
    next.setAttribute('aria-label',step===stages.length-1?'Continue to the next section':'Next stage: '+stages[step+1].name);
    progress.forEach((button,i)=>{
      button.classList.toggle('is-active',i===step);
      button.classList.toggle('is-complete',i<step);
      if(i===step)button.setAttribute('aria-current','step');
      else button.removeAttribute('aria-current');
    });
    notifyFrame();
  }
  back.addEventListener('click',()=>select(step-1));
  next.addEventListener('click',()=>{
    if(step===stages.length-1){
      const following=scene.nextElementSibling;
      if(following)following.scrollIntoView({behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches?'instant':'smooth',block:'start'});
    }else select(step+1);
  });
  progress.forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>select(Number(button.dataset.climbStep))));
  frame.addEventListener('load',notifyFrame);
  select(0);
})();
</script></body></html>
